<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Improved Identify</h1>
<p>Sphere: Detection Sphere
Spell Tier: 4
Class: Conjurer (guild level 21), Sorcerer (guild level 28)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast improved identify &lt;object&gt;
</pre>
<p>Tells you everything identify does (see <a cmd='#'>Help Identify</a>), and more:
</p>
<ul><li>the exact craftsmanship and magic numbers of weapons and armour,</li>
<li>which race a weapon is made to slay,</li>
<li>the spells stored in potions, scrolls, wands and staffs,</li>
<li>how strongly a light shines, or a darkness dims.</li></ul>
<p>It works on things in the room, in your inventory, or that you wear. You 
must be standing. It is also found on wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Identify</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Evaluate</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Detection Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>